  "pre_launch_features": "DefiLlama api.llama.fi/protocol/{slug}: the TVL history up to the day before the token first traded (TVL that day, TVL change over the seven days before, age = days from the first TVL record to the launch), and the category DefiLlama records for the protocol (null where it records none; the model then uses the global multiple)",
